// Asteroid mining: work $ASTEROID_BELT$, deposit at $STATION$.
// Tokens are resolved by the worker at fit time (pkg/worker/tokens.go) and the
// drone receives literal POI ids. Order matters: the first matching branch runs
// and its action ends the tick, and a WAIT tick earns neither ore nor
// drone_control XP -- so travel is kept to the two unavoidable legs.
IF traveling()
  WAIT
ELSE IF cargo_full()
  IF at("$STATION$")
    DEPOSIT
  ELSE
    MOVE "$STATION$"
  END
ELSE
  IF at("$ASTEROID_BELT$")
    MINE
  ELSE
    MOVE "$ASTEROID_BELT$"
  END
END
